## Item 8 verdict on commit 3b22a6af
- The change rewrites tests U2G10 and U2G11 of tests/storytime-u2-guards.test.ts so the CLI runs
  in a temp repository (scripts copied, node_modules symlinked) instead of the real repository.
- The file is outside the Owned paths of the spec.
- Verdict: SAFE TEST HARDENING, not a scope fault. Reason: the old form ran the muse CLI with the
  real repository as cwd and then deleted the real unit 2 and family-word folders when the run had
  created them. Step F proved this pattern was a live hazard: the test CVG9 wrote into the real
  cover cost file and deleted it. The change keeps every assertion and test name, changes no
  production code, and removes a real data-loss risk to the cost files this track's guard reads.
  Recorded as a nonblocking finding for the record.

